  "claim_localizations":[
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1215-posadnik-and-tysyatsky-jointly-invite-prince","locale":"en","runtime_text":"In 1215 the posadnik and tysyatsky travelled together from Novgorod to invite Yaroslav Vsevolodovich to rule as prince. This is one dated joint mission, not a permanent power or a current delegation.","search_aliases":[]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1218-distinguishes-princely-and-novgorodian-tysyatsky","locale":"en","runtime_text":"In the 1218–1219 episode the source distinguishes the prince's own tysyatsky from Novgorodian officials. This is a bounded distinction in a conflict, not a universal office structure.","search_aliases":[]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1229-veche-episode-removes-and-replaces-tysyatsky","locale":"en","runtime_text":"In the 1228–1229 chronicle episode the whole city, acting from the veche, deprived Vyacheslav of the tysyatsky's office, which went to Boris Negochevich. This was a violent crisis removal, not an ordinary procedure.","search_aliases":[]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1230-source-uses-hundred-term-for-property-division","locale":"en","runtime_text":"In the 1230 account a deposed posadnik's property is divided po stom (by hundreds). This is a term used in one crisis distribution, not a map of hundreds or their jurisdiction.","search_aliases":[]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-mid-xii-mixed-court-comparator","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Yanin describes an early mixed-court comparator: the posadnik appears after the formally prior prince, who sealed judicial acts. This is mid-twelfth-century material, not a court of 1230.","search_aliases":[]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-bishop-and-archbishop-titles-not-simple-date-marker","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Yanin's source-critical caution says that Novgorodian bishop and archbishop titles after 1165 are not a simple dating indicator. This supplies neither an archbishop's power nor a current cleric.","search_aliases":[]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1215-posadnik-and-tysyatsky-jointly-invite-prince","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"В 1215 году посадник и тысяцкий вместе ездили от Новгорода приглашать Ярослава Всеволодовича на княжение. Это один датированный совместный выезд, не постоянное полномочие или текущая делегация.","search_aliases":["1215","посадник","тысяцкий","Ярослав","посольство"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1218-distinguishes-princely-and-novgorodian-tysyatsky","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"В эпизоде 1218–1219 годов источник различает «своего тысяцкого» князя и новгородских должностных лиц. Это ограниченное различение в конфликте, не универсальная должностная схема.","search_aliases":["княжеский тысяцкий","1219","князь"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1229-veche-episode-removes-and-replaces-tysyatsky","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"В 1228–1229 годах летописный эпизод сообщает, что весь город с веча лишил Вячеслава тысяцкого, а должность получил Борис Негочевич. Это кризисное и насильственное смещение, не обычная процедура.","search_aliases":["Вячеслав","Борис Негочевич","вече","тысяцкий"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-1230-source-uses-hundred-term-for-property-division","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"В сообщении 1230 года имущество свергнутого посадника делится «по стом». Это употребление термина в одном кризисном разделе, не карта сотен или их юрисдикция.","search_aliases":["по стом","сотня","Водовик","1230"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-mid-xii-mixed-court-comparator","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Янин описывает ранний смешанный судебный comparator: посадник фигурирует после формально приоритетного князя, который скреплял судебные акты печатью. Это материал середины XII века, не суд 1230 года.","search_aliases":["суд","посадник","князь","печать"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-government-law-v2-bishop-and-archbishop-titles-not-simple-date-marker","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"По источниковедческой оговорке Янина титулы новгородского епископа и архиепископа после 1165 года не служат простым датировочным признаком. Это не полномочие владыки и не текущий клирик.","search_aliases":["епископ","архиепископ","владыка","1165"]}
  ]
